[PackageName]
7-Zip

[Version]
26.00

[OS]
XP

[InstallerName]
7zip

[InstallDir]
\7zip

[URL]
x86: 7zip.pie (default)
x64: 7zip-x64.pie
::end

[ProFile]
7-Zip 是一款适用于 Windows 系统的文件压缩软件。

[ProFile_En]
7-Zip is a file archiver for Windows.

[DefaultOpen]
7zFM.exe
::end

[Alias]
zip: 7z.exe a -tzip $1 $2
7z: 7z.exe a -t7z $1 $2
gz: 7z.exe a -tgzip $1 $2
xz: 7z.exe a -txz $1 $2
unzip: 7z.exe x $1 -o$2
::end

[Author]
Igor Pavlov.

[Distributor]
Sanakaprix

[PackageSize]
4.14 MB

